# Exclude dev-only and non-runtime material from the FastAPI Cloud bundle.
# The service needs the `glitch_signal` package, `main.py`, `pyproject.toml`,
# and (for migrations) `alembic/` + `alembic.ini`. Everything below is dev
# tooling, tests, ops scaffolding, or examples that the running app never
# imports.

# Version control / caches
.git/
__pycache__/
*.py[cod]
.venv/
venv/
.mypy_cache/
.ruff_cache/
.pytest_cache/
.coverage
htmlcov/

# Secrets — never ship
.env
*.env
credentials/

# Dev-only
tests/
scripts/
ops/
.pre-commit-config.yaml
.github/
CONTRIBUTING.md

# Large generated media (should live in object storage, never the bundle)
*.mp4
*.mov
var/
tmp/
